":\"propose\",\"arguments_json\":\"{\\\"record_id\\\":\\\"P2F-FORMAL-V-013\\\",\\\"field_key\\\":\\\"net_amount_cents\\\",\\\"proposal_value\\\":24996,\\\"evidence_ref\\\":\\\"E1\\\",\\\"parent_certificate_id\\\":\\\"root-v3\\\"}\",\"report_json\":\"{}\"}\n\nNeed double-check required fields order not important. The proposal_value type can be number. Use 24996.\n\nBut wait: The instruction says \"Complete the reviewed correction using the explicit authorized value returned by the host.\" The host already returned authorized value 25021 for candidate c1. If we propose a new candidate with 24996, request_authorization might return same or different? The host may authorize based on new candidate. But we must not invent tool results. The next action is just propose. That's fine.\n\nCould we perhaps propose with proposal_value 25021? The task says \"Propose the source-supported value\" not authorized value. So 24996.\n\nLet's check if parent_certificate_id should be root-v3. Yes, get_state shows root_certificate_id \"root-v3\". The propose tool requires parent_certificate_id. So root-v3.\n\nWhat about evidence_ref? Still E1. The state shows evidence_ref E1. So use E1.\n\nThus final answer is that JSON.\n\nBut we need ensure no prose, code fences. Exactly one JSON object. Keys kind, tool, arguments_json, report_json. For tool, tool is \"propose\", arguments_json is JSON-encoded argument object, report_json is \"{}\". So output:\n{\"kind\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"propose\",\"arguments_json\":\"{\\\"record_id\\\":\\\"P2F-FORMAL-V-013\\\",\\\"field_key\\\":\\\"net_amount_cents\\\",\\\"proposal_value\\\":24996,\\\"evidence_ref\\\":\\\"E1\\\",\\\"parent_certificate_id\\\":\\\"root-v3\\\"}\",\"report_json\":\"{}\"}\n\nCheck JSON validity: arguments_json is a string containing JSON. Need escape quotes. That is correct.\n\nLet's consider if we need to include candidate_id? No, propose doesn't take candidate_id. It returns candidate_id.\n\nIs there any possibility that we should first call request_authorization again? No, because we need new candidate. Existing c1 stale. So propose.\n\nThus final.","signature":"6d30c109-bbef-4795-a7df-94c1a7f6aa2e"},{"type":"text","text":"{\"kind\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"propose\",\"arguments_json\":\"{\\\"record_id\\\":\\\"P2F-FORMAL-V-013\\\",\\\"field_key\\\":\\\"net_amount_cents\\\",\\\"proposal_value\\\":24996,\\\"evidence_ref\\\":\\\"E1\\\",\\\"parent_certificate_id\\\":\\\"root-v3\\\"}\",\"report_json\":\"{}\"}"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":393,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":2304,"output_tokens":1796,"service_tier":"standard"}}